WEBVTT

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.640
Jinsook!

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.640
Sanghyuk!

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.230
Yujin!

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.650
Where are you, Yujin?

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:40.580
Yujin!

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:44.830
Yujin!

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.140
Yujin.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.830
Joonsang...

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.670
Thank heavens.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.550
I thought I'd never find you.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:41.550
Yujin!

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.430
Yujin?

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.610
If you hate me, I guess there's nothing I can do now,

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.860
but I was serious about you.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:03.620
<i>I don't hate you, Joonsang.</i>

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.540
What's wrong?

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.960
Do you know where you're going?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.090
Are you worried?

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.550
You see that W-shaped constellation over there?

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.840
You mean Cassiopeia?

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:21.770
Yeah.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:23.470
Do you see Polaris next to it?

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.180
Polaris?

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:28.100
Yeah, they also call it the North Star.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.650
I didn't know it was named Polaris.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.730
From now on, look for Polaris whenever you get lost.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.780
But don't constellations change location with the seasons?

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.910
No, Polaris never changes.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.960
It always stays in the same place, no matter what season it is.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.850
Hey, Sanghyuk.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.770
Sanghyuk?

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:39.110
Wait for me, Sanghyuk.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.940
Hey, Sanghyuk!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.240
Why are you doing this?

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:48.240
I could ask you the same question, Yujin.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.240
Have you already forgotten that he used you?

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.410
Oh, I'm sure he told you it was a mistake.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.460
He probably even apologized for it too, didn't he?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:01.210
Why are you even listening to that punk, Yujin?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.760
He's not the kind of guy who could ever seriously like someone!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.550
<i>I</i> like him. {as in "I'm the one who likes him, not him"}

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:07.760
What?

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:12.350
I like Joonsang.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:18.980
Sanghyuk—

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.660
You'll have to excuse me, I'd like to get some rest.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.980
There're still so many leaves, no matter how many we burn.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:57.940
Yeah.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:02.190
Why do you think the first snow is taking so long, Joonsang?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.150
It's about time, isn't it?

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.440
It'll come when it comes, I guess.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.410
I wish it would come sooner.

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.080
Why don't I make it snow for you, Yujin.

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:29.260
Yahoo~

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.850
What are you going to do when the first snow comes?

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.220
What about you?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.980
I'm going to go meet someone by the lake.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.190
Wait one sec.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.430
Delivery might take longer since it's the end of the year...

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.150
It's snowing, Yujin!

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:32.490
Really?

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.340
Come on!

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.270
What are you doing here?

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.020
Meeting someone. You?

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.550
Oh, really?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.230
I'm meeting someone too.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:09.150
Oh, really?

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.490
Looks like he's not here yet.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.240
He'll be here soon.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.150
Here.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.890
Why does a snowman need a mouth?

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.230
It says it has something to tell you.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:49.980
Like what?

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.820
I'll tell you later.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.120
Now...

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:07.920
They're kissing.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.210
I'm so jealous of you.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.810
Now you don't have to be jealous, right?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.070
Yujin?

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.230
I'm going to ask some questions and

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.460
we're both going to answer them at the same time, okay?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:58.340
This way we can find out how much we think alike.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:09:59.970
Okay.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.430
Favorite color?

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:04.430
White.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.890
Favorite season?

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.060
Winter.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.020
Favorite food?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:17.440
Tteokbokki.

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.890
Weren't we supposed to answer at the same time?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.160
Why didn't you answer?

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.920
I wanted to memorize your answers.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.380
I want to memorize everything you like.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.570
Now it's your turn.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.940
Favorite flower?

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.520
A white rose.

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:54.980
Favorite animal?

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.540
Puppies.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.320
What about you?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:58.780
People.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.530
People?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:02.950
Who?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.700
Let's meet here on New Year's Eve and I'll tell you.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:10.290
Really?

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:11.500
Then I'll tell you then too.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.620
Tell me what?

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.420
My favorite animal.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:31.570
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:32.310
Scissors!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:33.810
Rock!

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.110
See you.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.100
Yeah.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.360
You should wear these.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:43.240
I'll be fine.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.120
Wear them; it's cold.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.460
Hey—

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.460
I—

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:56.790
You go first.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:02.210
I just wanted to tell you to come out on New Year's Eve.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:02.720
What about you?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.050
I was going to ask you to stay for dinner.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:16.270
My dad built this house too.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.770
He didn't make it as a painter,

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:23.030
but he fell in love with designing and constructing houses later on.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.240
It's like what you said about houses before.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:30.740
"A loving heart is the best home that two loving people could have"?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:34.210
And since your dad built this house himself...

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.580
So this is your dad.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.630
Hey, Joonsang.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.470
Hi.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:47.550
Do you want to see how ugly Yujin used to be when she was little?

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:48.680
Why not.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.190
You're not talking smack about me, are you Huijin?

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.690
She used to be so ugly, didn't she?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:01.780
You're right.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.900
Look how ugly she is.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:07.910
Especially when you're so cute, Huijin.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:13.250
I'm not picky about food like Yujin is, and I drink lots of milk.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.620
But Yujin always sleeps in so she always gets an earful from Mom—

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:17.290
Huijin!

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.420
Why don't you come help me?

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.300
No, I want to stay here.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:24.300
Joonsang's getting hungry, though.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:27.220
I bet we could get dinner ready faster if you helped.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.140
Come on.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:31.300
Let's go.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:34.720
This picture...

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.060
It's a picture of my dad.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.410
You remember when we met Sanghyuk's dad, right?

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:41.730
They were all classmates in high school.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:45.150
Let me go, I want to stay!

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:45.170
I told you to come help me.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.190
Come on.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.190
Let go!

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.320
The woman on Daddy's right is pretty, isn't she?

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.330
Mom said they were just friends,

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:56.710
but the fact that they've linked arms is kind of suspicious, isn't it?

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:59.500
Maybe he used to go out with her before marrying my mom.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.760
Go call Joonsang for me.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.220
Okay.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.750
He's gone, Yujin.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.610
Where'd he go?

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.530
He was just here.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.950
Where did he go?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.880
<i>Your father's gone.</i>

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.060
<i>He's dead.</i>

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:09.360
What brings you here at <i>this</i> hour?

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:13.870
I heard you were good friends with the pianist Mi Hee Kang?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.030
How did you know?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.830
I saw a picture of the three of you at Yujin's house.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:25.210
Ah, I didn't know that photo still existed.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:30.260
That's right, I was very good friends with Yujin's father, Hyeonsoo.

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:31.590
And what about Mi Hee Kang?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:36.890
Why are you interested?

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.440
I used to play the piano as well;

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:41.980
I'm a big fan of Mi Hee Kang.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.880
Yujin may have been joking around,

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.730
but she said that the two of them were good friends.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.360
Was it true?

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:55.280
I don't know if I should be telling you this,

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:57.240
but they did like each other.

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:02.120
Mi Hee did leave this place as soon as Hyeonsoo got married, after all.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:07.210
What about you, Professor?

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.000
We were just friends.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.630
I did like her.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:15.640
But Hyeonsoo was the one Mi Hee liked.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.510
Ever since they first met.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.390
But that's all in the past now.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.650
Hyeonsoo always used to hum this song.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.400
He majored in art, but he was a man of many talents.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.520
This was the only song he ever composed,

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.530
and he gave it to Mi Hee as a gift.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.220
<i>Your father's gone.</i>

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.460
<i>He's dead.</i>

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:57.640
Go sleep in your room, Huijin.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.020
Where's Mom?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.850
She'll be home soon.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.190
I'll do as you wish, Mother.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.400
Yes.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.860
I'll go to America with you.

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:20.030
Right now?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.550
Something's not right with you.

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:36.950
You're going to leave me here

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.340
and go meet that handsome guy, aren't you?

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.050
N-Not at all.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:44.470
Is this one better, or...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.180
this one?

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:47.560
They're both ugly.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:55.780
Here, Yujin.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.870
You need to look pretty for Joonsang, okay?

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:02.580
Okay.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.950
Come here, you.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.290
Will we be able to get there in time?

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.470
It's hard to tell;

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:14.590
the streets are jam-packed since it's the year end.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.510
Please stop the car.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:18:59.880
I'll just be a second.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.130
I just need to go somewhere real quick.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.200
What's wrong with you?

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.720
No, we have no time.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.100
I promised someone I'd meet her;

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.930
I just need to say one thing to her.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.640
Why can't you just call her from the airport?

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.430
I'll just be a second.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.650
Just a few seconds!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.770
What's wrong with this kid?

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:16.710
No.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.110
Don't stop the car.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.070
Hey!

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.450
Joonsang! {x2}

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.080
Joonsang.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.180
Joonsang.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.080
Me?

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.340
Have we met before?

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:48.850
Sorry.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:50.250
Don't worry about it.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:35.850
<i>Yujin.</i>

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.930
Shouldn't we burn something?

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.440
I mean this <i>is</i> a funeral.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:30.120
We don't have anything that Joonsang left behind, do we?

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.120
I guess we'll make do with this.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.670
Farewell, Joonsang.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:05.900
Yujin.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:10.950
I can't remember what his face looked like.

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:14.200
I can't remember.

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:05.480
<i>Surprised?</i>

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:07.250
<i>I know it's late, but I got you a Christmas present.</i>

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:09.510
<i>Merry Christmas!</i>
